          <td class="col-india">60% of companies offer it; avg cover ₹60,000</td>
          <td class="col-global">95% of companies offer it; avg cover ₹1,00,000</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>OPD &amp; pharmacy</strong></td>
          <td class="col-india">16% of companies offer it</td>
          <td class="col-global">60% of companies offer it</td>
        </tr>
