      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:8px;">Source: Plum State of Employee Benefits 2024. Analysis of 4,500+ employee healthcare plans.</p>

    <div style="margin-top:28px;">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:10px;">What the market looks like at each headcount stage</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Your candidates have worked at Indian companies before. This is what those companies were carrying. Now you know what you're being measured against.</p>

      <div class="table-scroll"><table class="bench-table">
        <thead>
